{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in an RNA-only multiprofile model using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving a validation accuracy of 0.6530 (from 0.6501) and F1 of 0.6283. The slight improvement suggests transformer aggregation may offer marginal gains, though the small effect size and lack of direct comparisons with other aggregation methods leave uncertainty about its relative effectiveness. The RNA-only setting excludes potential benefits of multimodal integration."
}

